{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00047","headline":"浪淘沙二首 · 皇甫松","name":"浪淘沙二首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"滩头细草接疏林，浪恶罾船半欲沉。 宿鹭眠洲非旧浦，去年沙觜是江心。 蛮歌豆蔻北人愁，松雨蒲风野艇秋。 浪起䴔䴖眠不得，寒沙细细入江流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"周啸天"}